@startuml
title 7.5 Checkout Vouchers - sequence diagram
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam wrapWidth 240
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam sequence {
  LifeLineBorderColor #888888
  ParticipantBorderColor #444444
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
}

actor Customer as U
participant "View" as V <<View>> #EADCFF
participant OrderController as C <<Controller>> #D8F3DC
participant OrderService as S <<Service>> #DCECFF
participant CartItemRepository as CIR <<Repository>> #FFF1C9
participant ProductQuotaService as Q <<Service>> #DCECFF
participant GhnService as GHN <<Service>> #DCECFF
participant "GHN API" as GAPI <<External>> #FFE0E0
participant CouponService as CS <<Service>> #DCECFF
participant CouponRepository as CR <<Repository>> #FFF1C9

== A. Checkout shows the usable vouchers for each shop ==
U -> V : open /checkout (ticked cart items, delivery address)
loop each shop group (250 ms after each change)
  V -> C : POST /api/orders/{userId}/voucher-preview\n(shopId, cartItemIds, deliveryAddressId, couponId = chosen code,\nshippingCouponCode, merchandiseOnly)
  note right of V : merchandiseOnly = true while the shop's shipping fee is not known yet
  C -> C : requireOwner(userId, currentUser)
  alt not the logged-in user
    C --> V : 403 "Không có quyền truy cập đơn hàng này."
  else
    C -> S : previewVouchers(userId, request, merchandiseOnly)
    alt merchandiseOnly and a shipping code was sent
      S --> C : 400 "Cần tính phí giao hàng trước khi áp mã phí ship."
    else
      S -> S : duplicate cart item ids: 400 "Danh sách sản phẩm bị trùng."
      loop each cart item id
        S -> CIR : findById(cartItemId)
        CIR --> S : CartItem
        S -> S : belongs to user and shop, product and shop ACTIVE\n(else 400 "Sản phẩm không thuộc giỏ hàng/shop đang chọn hoặc đã ngừng bán.")
      end
      S -> Q : requireAllowed(product) for each item
      Q --> S : ok (else 400 product locked by the shop plan limit)
      opt not merchandiseOnly
        S -> GHN : calculateFee (shop origin, delivery address)
        GHN -> GAPI : fee request
        GAPI --> GHN : fee
        GHN --> S : shippingFee
      end
      S -> CS : preview(context: shopId, subTotal, shippingFee, productTotals,\norderCode, shippingCode)
      CS -> CR : available(shopId)
      CR --> CS : List<Coupon> (platform + this shop, not deleted)
      CS -> CS : reason() per coupon (status, dates, usage, shop, minimum order, saving > 0)
      CS -> CS : selected codes: unknown 400 "Mã giảm giá không tồn tại hoặc không áp dụng cho shop này."\nineligible 400 "CODE: reason"
      CS -> CS : sort money and shipping lists, each with eligible, saving, reason
      CS --> S : Preview (no usedCount change)
      S --> C : Preview
      C --> V : 200 OK
    end
  end
end
V --> U : "Ưu đãi cho đơn hàng": radio lists "Giảm phí giao hàng" and\n"Giảm tiền hàng / sản phẩm", "Không dùng mã" first, ineligible ones greyed out with reason

== B. Rules shown in the list ==
note over CS
  At most one money voucher and one shipping voucher.
  With a shipping voucher selected, only the money voucher with the lowest eligible saving is allowed.
  Money choices that break this rule are marked "mã voucher không phù hợp".
end note
note over V
  Changing the shipping choice also clears the money choice (the eligible list changes).
  While the request runs, "Đặt hàng" stays disabled.
end note

@enduml
